# The GitHub wiki clone. It is its own repository, with its own remote
# (agent-torvalds.wiki.git) and its own history - the wiki pages are
# published from there, not from this repository. Committing it here would
# record a gitlink that no clone of this repository could resolve.
wiki/

# MikroTik RouterOS target configuration - it holds real credentials.
