# The PR-body backup from 2026-10-27.
# It holds the pull-request bodies **as they were before** the Claude Code
# footer was removed, so it contains the very text this repository is being
# cleaned of.  It is a local safety net for the footer normalisation and
# must not be committed to a repository the operator wants Claude-free.
pr-body-backup-2026-10-27/
